OL,3,GNEWSAEmpty former city nightclub hit by
OL,4,Ablaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have worked through the
OL,7,Fnight to deal with a fire at a former
OL,8,Fnightclub in Stoke-on-Trent.
OL,10,FThey were called to the disused
OL,11,Ffour-storey property on Trinity Street
OL,12,Fin Hanley just after 19:00 BST on
OL,13,FThursday and sealed off the surrounding
OL,14,Farea.
OL,16,FThe crews remained at the scene until
OL,17,Fthe morning to make it safe.
OL,19,FAn investigation is due to get under
OL,20,Fway into the cause of the fire at the
OL,21,Fbuilding, which was once home to Groove
OL,22,FCastle.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
